# The power service (power(8), D130): every CPU with ACPI's CPPC at its
# highest performance level, its desired-performance registers' pages
# carved from the MMIO resource; the thermal zones read at their period,
# a step down at a passive trip and power-off at a critical one, through
# devmgr's /dev/reboot. devmgr's `cpus` and `thermal` say what there is.
service power
program power
resource mmio
export
use devmgr
mount /dev devmgr/dev
restart on-failure
